// The seed every kudo-node starts governed with: exact argvs a worker may run
// on any node without asking. Everything else waits for the author's verdict
// in the kudo console, where "allow always" grows the node's own rules
// (standing-rules.styx in its state directory) — this file stays small and
// read-only.
allow (
  (uptime)
  (df -h)
  (free -h)
  (nixos-version)
)
deny ()
